      50.88,
      394.4,
      286.68,
      581.35
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub section (1) of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude* which is required for a public purpose:- Description of the land for servitude to be acquired: The allotment of land in total extent of 0.0519 hectare, as lot No. 1037 depicted in the Preliminary Plan No. 69 and dated 31st August 2018, prepared by the surveyor -General situated in the village of Welipenna in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Matugama in the District of Kalutara-in Western Province morefully described as follows.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.118988037109375,
